"""The ARGIA wordmark — "ARGIA / Smart Energy Solutions", the official
asset (Tomasz, 2026-09-10: the portal is the whole company's now, not
only solar). Transparent PNG, 764x120, as a data URI so every page and
every mail carries it without a second request.

The lockup is 6.36 times as wide as it is tall and the tagline is three
stacked lines, so it needs about 34px of height to stay legible — the
old ARGIA SOLAR wordmark was one line and read fine at 26px. Anything
that shows it smaller shows an unreadable smudge.
"""
LOGO_URI = 'data:image/png;base64,'
LOGO_HEIGHT_PX = 34          # the smallest height at which the tagline still reads

# The compact mark: 'ARGIA' on its own, for places too tight for the tagline
# (the daily mail header, where the logo is deliberately smaller than the
# title). 412x96, ratio 4.3.
MARK_URI = 'data:image/png;base64,'
LOGO_ALT = 'ARGIA — Smart Energy Solutions'
